cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use methylTFR, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "methylTFR: Quantification of DNA methylation signatures in TFBS"
abstract: >-
  methylTFR is an R/Bioconductor package for analyzing DNA methylation
  signatures within transcription factor binding sites (TFBS) in individual
  cells or samples. It computes a GC-bias-corrected deviation score of
  methylation levels at TF binding sites.
